# Product Factory — Global Rules

Read the full orchestrator: [.claude/skills/product-factory/SKILL.md](../.claude/skills/product-factory/SKILL.md)

## Language

- All artifacts, code comments, commit messages, and agent outputs: **English** unless the user explicitly requests another language.
- End-user product copy may use the market language documented in the PRD.

## Mandatory security review (non-negotiable)

Do **not** mark frontend or backend work as complete until security agents have reviewed the change:

| After changes from | Invoke |
| ------------------ | ------ |
| Agent 11 (Layout Build) or 12 (React Frontend) | **Agent 16** — [.claude/agents/16-frontend-security.md](../.claude/agents/16-frontend-security.md) or Cursor subagent `frontend-security` |
| Agent 13 (Database) or 14 (Backend) | **Agent 17** — [.claude/agents/17-backend-security.md](../.claude/agents/17-backend-security.md) or Cursor subagent `backend-security` |

- **Block merge/release** on open Critical/High findings.
- Full-stack changes require **both** 16 and 17.
- Policy: [.claude/references/product-gates.md](../.claude/references/product-gates.md#security-on-change)

